{
  "slug": "count-tongulas-workspace",
  "name": "Count Tongulas Workspace",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Create team workspaces with shared context across multiple repos. Run /count-tongulas-workspace:create and walk through an interactive setup — enter your team name and repos, and it scaffolds everything: a repo registry (repos.json) with GitHub metadata, a CLAUDE.md with repo map and deployment table, a Makefile with workspace commands, and a bootstrap script that clones all repos. Designed for teams working across many repositories who want Claude Code to understand the full system.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, `audit` (Audit a workspace for drift — reconcile claims in `.claude/CLAUDE.md` and `repos.json` against the actual state of the…), `create` (Create a workspace with shared context across multiple repos — for teams or personal projects).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install count-tongulas-workspace@claude-community` from `alextongme/count-tongulas-toolkit` (`plugins/workspace`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
